&lt;p&gt;Alpha FMC is the leading global consultancy to the Wealth &amp;amp; Retail Investment, Asset Management and Insurance industries. As a trusted partner to 100% of the top 20 global Asset &amp;amp; Wealth Management firms by AUM, we have an unrivalled track record in providing our base of over 660 clients with a competitive edge by using our deep industry knowledge and expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
