&lt;p&gt;We are rapidly expanding and seeking an experienced, technologically savvy Account Executive who loves selling cloud infrastructure or DevOps products. As a member of our growing Sales team, you&#39;ll work alongside the founding team and engineers to dramatically influence the future of our users&#39; infrastructure and help develop new sales channels by reaching diverse audiences throughout organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
