&lt;li&gt;Process, data-driven sales background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sales tech stack experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to exercise effective judgment, sensitivity, and creativity in changing needs and situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel as needed for high-touch client engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
